{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1793724469612347717,"compiled_state":{"alias":"frouzy-downfallen-salamander","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":2},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1793719255701691001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"84eb75b1-1e55-477c-b29c-6f00ab07e37e","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"6e4d-c3a4-1e0c-46e4"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n\n`make lint` fails when a per-session scratch directory holds a virtualenv. `scripts/check_shellcheck.py::discover` walks `root.rglob(\"*.sh\")` and skips only the names in `EXCLUDED_DIRS` (`.venv`, `.git`, `.claude`, `.tickets-tracker`, `.tickets-hotpath-authoritative`, `node_modules`). Its comment says agent scratch is never linted, but `.rebar/scratch/` (the scratch path AGENTS.md prescribes) is not excluded, and a venv not literally named `.venv` is not either.\n\nObserved 2026-11-03 in worktree `fix-langur`: a non-editable reproduction venv at `.rebar/scratch/a85e3cd3-langur/nonedit-venv` made `make lint` exit 2 with SC2050 in `site-packages/virtualenv/activation/bash/activate.sh`. Removing the venv made `make lint` exit 0. The path is git-ignored (`.gitignore:23: .rebar/*`).\n\n## Approach\n\nExclude git-ignored paths from discovery, or at minimum add `.rebar` to `EXCLUDED_DIRS`, so the linter only judges shell the repository owns.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] A test places a `*.sh` file with a shellcheck warning under `.rebar/scratch/<x>/` in a temp root and asserts `discover` does not return it.\n- [ ] `make lint` exits 0 with a virtualenv present under `.rebar/scratch/`.\n\nFound while resolving `targeted-northbound-langur` (session a85e3cd3).","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"d552-a55e-2877-47ef","ticket_type":"bug","title":"check_shellcheck lints git-ignored .rebar/scratch, so a scratch venv fails make lint","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["be30d410-c446-4641-b35a-6f8cca3f76be","84eb75b1-1e55-477c-b29c-6f00ab07e37e"]},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1793724469612347717,"uuid":"bb283470-fc41-4f1e-a723-1e0778861213"}